customer: nice_guy
problem: broken_hard_drive
brief:
	A calm errand.
	The Skater picks up his defragged computer this evening, with a special dialogue: he is hooked and needs it back.

== drop-off
(happy) Hi there! No rush at all, I know you're busy.
+ Wet out there?
	(happy) Pouring. But the plants are happy, so I'm happy.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(problem) My computer starts, and then the whole screen goes blue with white text. Then it restarts.
	+ Any strange noises?
		(neutral) Now that you say it, it clicks. Like a little woodpecker inside.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
		(happy) Thank you so much. Take your time.

== pick-up
(happy) No more blue! You're a star.
